{
  "description": "TC-WT-007: 回抽量和装填量计算测试用例 - 验证不同耗材类型的回抽/装填参数",
  "bugs": ["11460", "11462", "11463", "13303", "13309", "13379", "13534", "13537", "13555"],
  "level": "L2",
  "param_name": "tc_wt_007",
  "cases": [
    {
      "project_name": "tc_wt_007_pla_tpu",
      "input_3mf": "tc_wt_007_pla_tpu.3mf",
      "expected_value": "{\"tool_params\": {\"T0\": {\"retraction_length\": 5.0, \"extra\": 0.0, \"before_change\": {\"before_wipe\": 4.0, \"during_wipe\": 0.95, \"after_wipe\": 0.05}}, \"T1\": {\"retraction_length\": 8.0, \"extra\": 0.2, \"after_infill_retract\": {\"first\": 6.4, \"second\": 1.52, \"third\": 0.08}}}, \"from_tool\": \"T0\", \"to_tool\": \"T1\", \"check_points\": [\"before_change\", \"after_change\", \"purge_line\", \"after_infill_retract\"]}",
      "description": "PLA+TPU组合: T0(PLA 5.0mm) → T1(TPU 8.0mm+0.2mm) - 验证填充后回抽，公式: (1.52+0.08)=8×0.2, 6.4+1.6=8"
    },
    {
      "project_name": "tc_wt_007_pla_petg",
      "input_3mf": "tc_wt_007_pla_petg.3mf",
      "expected_value": "{\"tool_params\": {\"T0\": {\"retraction_length\": 5.0, \"extra\": 0.0, \"before_change\": {\"before_wipe\": 4.0, \"during_wipe\": 0.95, \"after_wipe\": 0.05}}, \"T1\": {\"retraction_length\": 6.0, \"extra\": 0.2, \"after_infill_retract\": {\"single\": 6.0}}}, \"from_tool\": \"T0\", \"to_tool\": \"T1\", \"check_points\": [\"before_change\", \"after_change\", \"purge_line\", \"after_infill_retract\"]}",
      "description": "PLA+PETG组合: T0(PLA 5.0mm) → T1(PETG 6.0mm+0.2mm) - 验证填充后回抽，单段回抽6.0mm"
    },
    {
      "project_name": "tc_wt_007_petg_tpu",
      "input_3mf": "tc_wt_007_petg_tpu.3mf",
      "expected_value": "{\"tool_params\": {\"T0\": {\"retraction_length\": 6.0, \"extra\": 0.2, \"before_change\": {\"before_wipe\": 4.2, \"during_wipe\": 1.71, \"after_wipe\": 0.09}}, \"T1\": {\"retraction_length\": 8.0, \"extra\": 0.3, \"after_infill_retract\": {\"first\": 5.6, \"second\": 2.28, \"third\": 0.12}}}, \"from_tool\": \"T0\", \"to_tool\": \"T1\", \"check_points\": [\"before_change\", \"after_change\", \"purge_line\", \"after_infill_retract\"]}",
      "description": "PETG+TPU组合: T0(PETG 6.0mm+0.2mm) → T1(TPU 8.0mm+0.3mm) - 验证填充后回抽，公式: (2.28+0.12)=8×0.3, 5.6+2.4=8"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "需要配置双挤出头(T0/T1)，分别使用不同耗材类型",
    "每种耗材配置不同的回抽长度(retraction_length)",
    "TPU等软性材料通常需要更大的回抽量",
    "回抽量由以下参数共同决定:",
    "  - filament_retraction_length: 每个耗材的总回抽长度(如T0=5mm, T1=8mm)",
    "  - retract_before_wipe: 擦拭前回抽的比例(如70%)",
    "  - filament_retract_before_wipe: 每个耗材的擦拭前回抽比例配置",
    "Bug 11460: 换料前回抽 - 擦拭前、擦拭时、擦拭后三个回抽应使用当前耗材(T0)的retraction_length参数，校验总和是否等于T0的参数",
    "Bug 11462: 换料后装填量 - 擦拭塔填充时的装填量应使用当前耗材(T0)的retraction_length + extra参数，与回抽保持一致",
    "Bug 11463: 擦嘴线装填量 - 擦嘴线处的装填量应使用正确的T1参数",
    "Bug 13303: 打完填充后的回抽 - 三段回抽总量应使用T1参数，验证公式: (retraction_length + extra)部分 = retraction_length × 0.2，总回抽量约等于retraction_length",
    "Bug 13309: 填充和外墙的装填量应使用正确的耗材参数",
    "Bug 13379: 额外装填量(extra_prime_amount)计算正确性 - extra参数遵循公式: extra = retraction_length × 0.2的比例关系",
    "Bug 13534-13555: 关注层间换色场景的参数正确性"
  ]
}
